00:26:57.660 --> 00:27:00.312
One photo. Do you still like me?

288
00:27:00.552 --> 00:27:01.592
What's wrong

289
00:27:01.936 --> 00:27:03.620
You don't answer anything

290
00:27:03.620 --> 00:27:05.428
Miss me and you will regret it

291
00:27:05.648 --> 00:27:08.064
Do you think you can ever meet someone as handsome as me?

292
00:27:09.388 --> 00:27:11.668
People can't just look at faces

293
00:27:13.032 --> 00:27:14.856
I will regret missing you

294
00:27:15.256 --> 00:27:16.788
I know it's a bit late

295
00:27:17.532 --> 00:27:19.192
But can you give me a chance...

296
00:27:19.576 --> 00:27:22.012
I don't want to be with you with a hurt heart

